# bat config. "base16" renders via the terminal's 16 ANSI colours, so bat stays
# consistent with kitty/alacritty automatically — and since this rice uses the
# official Catppuccin Mocha ANSI palette, that IS Catppuccin. No .tmTheme or
# `bat cache --build` needed.
--theme="base16"
--style="numbers,changes,header"
